{"unit_id":"tag:06GF:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是 <MATH_0002> 中的环映射（ring map）。若 <MATH_0003> 具有下列性质，就称它为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>本质满射（essential surjection）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0004> 是满射（surjective）的。\n<STRUCT_0003> 若 <MATH_0005> 是 <MATH_0006> 中的环映射（ring map），使得 <MATH_0007> 是满射（surjective）的，则 <MATH_0008> 是满射（surjective）的。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射"},{"source_term":"essential surjection","target_term":"本质满射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射","context":"本质满射定义，待决。"},{"source_term":"essential surjection","target_term":"本质满射","context":"定义的术语，待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"定义中的满射条件，待决。"}],"notes":[]}
