{"unit_id":"tag:06S5:proof","translation":"假设 (3)。设 <MATH_0001> 是 <MATH_0002> 中的环映射（ring map），使得 <MATH_0003> 是满射（surjective）的。则 <MATH_0004> 也是满射（surjective）的。由假设可得 <MATH_0005> 是满射（surjective）的。因此，应用引理 <REF_0001> 两次，可得 <MATH_0006> 是满射（surjective）的。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n假设 (1)。设 <MATH_0007> 是 <MATH_0008> 的态射（morphism），使得 <MATH_0009> 是满射（surjective）的。令\n<MATH_0010>\n由引理 <REF_0002>，它是 <MATH_0011> 的对象（object）。注意 <MATH_0012> 仍是满射（surjective）的，因此 <MATH_0013> 是满射（surjective）的，这是由引理 <REF_0003> 得到的。所以 <MATH_0014> 由假设是满射（surjective）的。这表明 <MATH_0015> 是满射（surjective）的，再由 <MATH_0016> 的构造可得 <MATH_0017> 是满射（surjective）的。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n第一段证明了 (3) <MATH_0018> (1)，第二段证明了 (1) <MATH_0019> (3)。(2) 与 (3) 的等价性（equivalence）是 (1) 与 (3) 的等价性（equivalence）的特例，因此证明完毕。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价性"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价性"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射","context":"本质满射判据证明，待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"各步骤的满射性，待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"测试本质性的态射，待决。"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"纤维积对象，待决。"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价性","context":"条件等价，待决。"}],"notes":[]}
