{"unit_id":"tag:06S9:proof","translation":"注意 <MATH_0001>，因为 <MATH_0002> 是满射（surjective）的，其核（kernel）为 <MATH_0003>。该映射（map）来自朴素余切复形（naive cotangent complex）的函子性（functoriality）。若 <MATH_0004> 是可分（separable）的，则 <MATH_0005> 是平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）的环映射（ring map），见《代数》（Algebra）中的引理 <REF_0001>。因此它的朴素余切复形（naive cotangent complex）具有平凡（trivial）的同调（homology）群（groups），见《代数》（Algebra）中的定义 <REF_0002>。于是将《代数》（Algebra）中的引理 <REF_0003> 应用于环映射（ring maps）<MATH_0006>，可得 <MATH_0007>。最后一个陈述的证明略去。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"naive cotangent complex","target_term":"朴素余切复形"},{"source_term":"functoriality","target_term":"函子性"},{"source_term":"separable","target_term":"可分"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"《代数》"},{"source_term":"naive cotangent complex","target_term":"朴素余切复形"},{"source_term":"trivial","target_term":"平凡"},{"source_term":"homology","target_term":"同调"},{"source_term":"groups","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"《代数》"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"《代数》"},{"source_term":"ring maps","target_term":"环映射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"同调比较，待决。"},{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核","context":"同调比较，待决。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"同调比较，待决。"},{"source_term":"naive cotangent complex","target_term":"朴素余切复形","context":"同调比较，待决。"},{"source_term":"functoriality","target_term":"函子性","context":"构造比较映射，待决。"},{"source_term":"separable","target_term":"可分","context":"域扩张条件，待决。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"域扩张的平展性，待决。"},{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射","context":"平展映射，待决。"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"《代数》","context":"引用章名，待决。"},{"source_term":"trivial","target_term":"平凡","context":"同调消失，